    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. So it's basically just the cocoa butter crystals being unstable? Could you walk me through the specific temperature steps I should be hitting to make sure I'm actually forming those stable crystals? I want to make sure my curve is perfect so I don't see that bloom again.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
